      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sync Scoring Tags\nThe Workflow will set the scoring tags on all EVI districts that are designated as a scoring district. \nThis is a Sync operation so it will remove add and remove tags from odoo to match EVICore.\n",
        "height": 554.1972408930528,
        "width": 1317.6636615332295
      },
